From a1c326b1523542f0600cd646063a2469dd90929f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ChopGimp <mathieu.redon@proton.me>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 06:25:34 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 176/177] ChopGimp 4.1.0: dead code and duplicated helpers
 removed

- 8 exported functions never called (artboards copy / set, crash log
  path, recolor image, timelapse state, interactive state, click group
  getter, vsel halt)
- new app/path/chopgimp-vutil.c: spec parsing and writing (word, number,
  body, signature), number writing, path of an object in a group, coords
  and anchors box, formerly copied in vbrush, vrepeat, vmaterial,
  vcolors, vobject, vlivepaint and the shape and pen tools

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
